= Lev Kamenev

Lev Kamenev is a former Bolshevik who opposed launching their failed revolution, he was recently expelled from the reorganized RKP(B) for his opposition to their leadership, and now advocates for class struggle within the RSDRP(O).

- @class_struggle
- @snap_election
- @against_toleration
- @root: Return to main

@class_struggle
title: Rally for class struggle
subtitle: The core of socialism should be the struggle of the proletariat against the bourgeoisie.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; workers_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_rsdrp += 3*(1-dissent); workers_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_rsdrp += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; left_strength += 5; left_dissent -= 5; old_middle_rsdrp -= 3; new_middle_rsdrp -= 2

Our message of class struggle appeals to the left wing of the working class, while alienating the intelligensia and bourgeois. [? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Our achievements in nationalization have assisted our messaging. ?]


@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Kamenev" : Kamenev must be Chariman. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and chancellor == "Kamenev"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12;

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

@against_toleration
title: Against toleration
subtitle: Break our current toleration arrangement, and bring down the government via a no-confidence vote.
