choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and rsdrp_toleration
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; rsdrp_toleration = 0; left_strength += 8; pro_republic -= 4; new_middle_rsdrp -= 3; rural_rsdrp -= 3; old_middle_rsdrp -= 3; catholics_rsdrp -= 3; reformist_dissent += 8

We have grown tired of the burdens of toleration, and have called a vote of no confidence in the current minority government.

